    "name": "Art of Blades",
    "steam_appid": 2883740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*NOTE:\u00a0This Game requires a 16:9 aspect ratio screen.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Extra Note: Please be aware that the game is currently only available in the <strong>English</strong> language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latest Update: 1.02</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/8d8cf0622ce645e47e46bcae4792b1e1.avif?t=1749734823\" width=720 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/c933230d8368f976049c2218578573d2.webp?t=1749734823\" width=680 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Art of Blades is a top-down, hand-drawn hack-and-slash adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >inspired by titles like the Legend of Zelda, featuring an art style reminiscent of Japanese manga and anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/04d6df46eee6a94154521086ee62193a.webp?t=1749734823\" width=680 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Art of Blades, you only have 1hp... but don't worry stamina takes the place of a traditional hp. Every attack, block/hit, or dash reduces your stamina. Managing your stamina is key, if it falls to zero its K.O. (GAMEOVER)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hack-and-slash action,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >every dodge, block or swing of your weapon brings excitement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can you become a master of combat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/0a20e4de79543ba7051cf6a1dd9084a8.webp?t=1749734823\" width=680 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face many different enemies in this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the fire spirits in the forgotten land, to the Guardians underneath the Catacombs, and into mysteries in the temple hidden in the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each enemy has unique traits, so you will need different strategies to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple Hack of the sword, maybe a dodge or block is required,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart them in quick combat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/8975eebc5dfdc5f60c9e659ba58a1e00.webp?t=1749734823\" width=680 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a stunning fantasy world where the beauty of feudal Japan meets  sci-fi. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, robots and magic exist side by side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of this vibrant world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883740/extras/b3640d800f2655843358072a7b9fc1bc.webp?t=1749734823\" width=680 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a Wanderer seeking  &quot;inspiration&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your adventure begins when you encounter an S.O.S. Droid,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > leading you into thrilling experiences in Art of Blades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What challenges await you on your journey? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Art of Blades is an original intellectual property of Samuele RS.</p>",
